ure used to indicate navigable water.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7977-a294-f8e77e1af329","description":"Mark Twain","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7139-a0ad-e828f742cfda","description":"Charles Dickens","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-77ed-9d64-60fdaa599538","description":"Kurt Vonnegut","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-782a-8d40-825c5fb20687","description":"Jean Paul Sartre","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7a7e-9e17-8bb6a7b481bf","category":"01a21312-b489-7dba-9459-62cdf152de47","question":"Which author wrote \'Twilight\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Stephenie Meyer\u2019s The Host was adapted into a 2013 film starring Saoirse Ronan.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-acdf-738a-bb4d-9fb76d4308cb","description":"Stephenie Meyer","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-71a6-8fa2-ab2048e61a8e","description":"Jack Vance","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-77f6-b691-26e5ec579977","description":"Brandon Sanderson","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-75af-90bd-05c3a58283bf","description":"Robert A. Heinlein","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7e49-8d27-8c2b42d4ba52","category":"01a21312-b489-7dba-9459-62cdf152de47","question":"Which artist painted \"Cafe Terrace at Night\"?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Vincent van Gogh painted the scene in Arles, France; the caf\u00e9 shown is on the Place du Forum.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7845-9aa3-07e1d37ab8fc","description":"Vincent van Gogh","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-72fd-9d55-cbb268bbd660","description":"Edvard Munch","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7e49-a7c4-a64b491130d1","description":"Peter Paul Rubens","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-78c0-a2fc-66fa48e000d0","description":"Rembrandt van Rijn","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-acdf-7d8b-9079-b8576de57a54","category":"01a21312-b489-7dba-9459-62cdf152de47","question":"Which author wrote \'Dune\'?","difficulty":2,"expla